sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as mcpserver-controller<br/>(operator pod)
    participant CM as ConfigMaps / Secrets
    participant MCPPod as MCP Server Pod<br/>{port}/TCP HTTP

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,MCPPod: Flow 1: MCPServer Reconciliation
        User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update MCPServer CR
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event (informer)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / ServiceAccount

        Controller->>K8sAPI: Read ConfigMaps & Secrets<br/>443/TCP HTTPS / Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: ConfigMap/Secret data

        Note over Controller: Validate spec, compute<br/>SHA-256 config hash

        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>443/TCP HTTPS / Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Deployment created

        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service (ClusterIP)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS / Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Service created

        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS / Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: NetworkPolicy created

        Note over Controller: Wait for Deployment Available

        Controller->>MCPPod: MCP Handshake (initialize)<br/>{spec.config.port}/TCP HTTP<br/>Streamable HTTP transport<br/>Backoff: 10s→2min, max 10 retries
        MCPPod-->>Controller: ServerInfo (name, version,<br/>protocol, capabilities)

        Controller->>K8sAPI: Update MCPServer status<br/>with ServerInfo + conditions<br/>443/TCP HTTPS / Bearer Token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,MCPPod: Flow 2: Config Change Rolling Update
        CM-->>Controller: ConfigMap/Secret change event<br/>(field index lookup)

        Controller->>K8sAPI: Read updated ConfigMap/Secret data<br/>443/TCP HTTPS / Bearer Token
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Updated data

        Note over Controller: Recompute SHA-256 config hash

        Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Deployment pod annotation<br/>(mcp.x-k8s.io/config-hash)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS / Bearer Token

        Note over K8sAPI,MCPPod: Kubernetes triggers rolling<br/>update due to annotation change
    end
